# ADR rules

- New decision: copy `template.md` → `NNNN-short-title.md`
- One decision per file
- Sections: Context → Options → Decision → Consequences
- Status: Proposed | Accepted | Deprecated | Superseded
- Update the index table in `README.md`
- Link accepted stack ADRs from `../02-tech/stack.md`
